        "text_G7eEn9": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Stock up smart with high-quality candles and bulk tealight options at prices that make sense for your business or event. From restaurants and venues to churches, catering setups, and significant events, tealights in large quantities are a simple way to elevate ambiance without inflating your budget.</p><p>We offer clear cup and aluminum cup options with burn times ranging from 3.5 to 8 hours. Each box is packed for reliability, clean burning, and consistent performance across all candles. No smoke. No mess. Just easy, effective lighting.</p><p>Looking for dependable supply and excellent value? Browse our tea candles bulk collection and enjoy free shipping on every order. Our tea light candles are designed to combine affordability with premium quality, making them a top choice for professionals and home users alike.<br/></p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "subheading_4W4pwU",
        "border_7FLkyj",
        "text_G7eEn9"
      ],
