          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>When details matter, the right candle makes a difference. Our bulk tea lights are made with top-grade wax and have high-quality cotton wicks for a steady flame that enhances every setting. From formal receptions and large-scale galas to intimate dinners and spa atmospheres, these high-quality candles deliver clean, subtle light without overpowering the space.</p><p>Perfect for lanterns, glass holders, or open displays, these tealights bulk options provide uniform quality, ideal when presentation and performance both count.</p><p>Need candles that hold up in the real world? Order bulk tealight candles designed to do their job, every time.<br/><br/></p>",
