        "text_kepcYj": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Professional event planners, venue managers, and hosts choose Kisco because our bulk tealight candles are built to perform and priced to keep your budget in check. You get consistent quality across every pack, backed by fast, free shipping and customer service that actually answers.</p><p>We source our products directly from premium European manufacturers, such as Bolsius, renowned for their long-lasting, clean-burning candles. That means fewer replacements, less cleanup, and more reliable lighting for your events.</p><p>Need a steady supply of tea candles in bulk for weekly use or one-time setups? Choose Kisco for quality you can trust and delivery you can count on.</p>",
