        "text_i6wFTU": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Time matters. That’s why our bulk tea lights come in multiple burn durations to fit your needs. Choose from 3.5-hour and 8-hour options, all tested for clean, consistent performance.</p><p>Our long-burning <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/tealights\" title=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/tealights\">tea lights</a> are ideal for events that run into the evening, as well as for restaurants and hotels. You won’t have to replace candles halfway through a dinner or ceremony. Just light once and enjoy an uninterrupted glow.</p><p>Looking for candles that go the distance? Our extended-burn time tea candles in bulk deliver real staying power.</p>",
